WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.160
Stop looking at me with your empty eyes!

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:29.820
Sotaro!

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:39.120
No! I don't want to be empty!

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.000
No!

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:48.530
Sotaro...

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:00.450
Jun-kun.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.450
Wake up, Jun-kun.

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:16.300
A job well done...

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:26.280
oh ware izukoe
Oh, where am I?

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:32.310
Oh ware yobukoe
Oh, the voice that's calling me

00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:35.790
umetsukusu jouhou
Immersing information

00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:40.160
ikigurushii kono joukyou
This suffocating situation

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:44.430
jibun ga inai
I'm not here

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:47.870
kono sekai no bousou
The world is going out of control

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:51.640
tada musekinin ni toubou
Run away irresponsibly

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:54.880
dokoe ikuno
Where am I going?

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:57.410
Huriyamanu ameni
The never-ending rain

00:01:57.410 --> 00:02:01.220
zubunure oitekareta kokoro ga
Soak the neglected heart

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:06.190
kuzure yuku chokuzen no koe wo kike
Listen to the voices before it collapses

00:02:06.190 --> 00:02:12.060
sasayakana kizunade ii
I'm fine with the subtle connection

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:17.870
sotto anata wo dakishimeru kara
I will hold you gently

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:29.380
kasaneta inochi ga yukkurito ima kokyuu shite iru
The overlapped souls breathe slowly

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:33.280
sobani iruyo
"I'll be by your side."

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:39.020
Oh ware izukoe
Oh, where am I?

00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:46.480
Oh ware yobukoe
Oh, the voice that's calling me

00:02:55.470 --> 00:02:57.060
We're finally able to pinpoint their location.

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:00.640
Let's alert the special force.

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:03.270
An infra-free underground facility...

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:08.140
Normally, it'd be impossible to
build this facility in such a place.

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:09.620
Then...

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:13.720
The request for special forces is a decoy.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.920
I'm glad we kept the members to a minimum.

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:19.320
We'll be able to conduct the negotiation efficiently.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:26.970
Kanzato Jun's Persona has the ability to detect
the distortion and pain of other Personas.

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:33.700
I was waiting for the Marebito to grow weak,
then use him to locate the Persona's pain, but...

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:37.210
I can't use my Persona right now.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:42.520
There's a possibility they may rage
when they find out he's incapable.

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:46.450
Let's depart.

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:49.290
Sanada-san!

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:52.430
Inui, I thought I asked you to
transport Shin and his friends.

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:53.520
Actually...

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.290
Nakamura-san is here.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:58.560
Nakamura? Who's that?

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:10.680
Geez, I wish they would've
told us the plan from the start.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.650
Either way, it'll be dangerous.

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:15.980
Well, even if they had told us...

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:16.920
We couldn't have...

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:18.580
You're right.

00:04:18.990 --> 00:04:21.350
So that was their sister.

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:22.850
Him...

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:26.520
Then where has Jun been all this time?

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.150
Right.

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:30.660
He's with the Whale.

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:33.300
Aniki too, probably.

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:39.370
I didn't want to involve Jun.

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:44.310
What kind of power does his Persona have,

00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:48.680
or what would happen if it were only Yuki?

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.340
I've never even...

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:54.020
I wonder if this is a punishment?

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:58.320
For what our parents did.

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:01.220
Kanzato-kun...

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:08.230
Many people fell into apathy,
got swapped around, died...

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:14.640
If all that happened because of the
research my parents were involved in...

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:17.650
Takuro's dad...

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:19.410
and your friend who liked music...

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:21.480
Kayano's brother,

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:24.080
Tasaka-senpai...

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:29.310
Morimoto... Yamasaki's
disappearance, and everything else...

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:36.030
If you're concerned about his
well-being, there's no need to worry.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:00.780
No!

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:02.620
No.

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:20.330
You did well for a sample body.

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:28.720
I observed an interesting phenomenon due to a
disagreement caused by a linking of multiple OS's.

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:29.510
However-

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:30.980
He...

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:34.140
Kanzato Jun is incapable.

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:48.030
Even if you transplant our distorted
Personas to another container,

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:52.870
they won't stabilize.

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:55.300
We already knew.

00:06:56.010 --> 00:06:58.170
We're just "visitors."

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:04.890
We won't be here when you reach your final goal.

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:08.820
Still... If there was a moral cause...

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:13.490
What irony. Puppets aren't
supposed to have hearts.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:20.030
All of you with closed hearts were
perfect as empty containers.

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:27.070
Give yourselves to the Lord of Unconsciousness
and return to where you belong.

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:51.090
Since your authority stuck his head in now...

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:53.020
Yes, that's right.

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:56.670
The Counselor is discharged
and the plan is canceled, huh?

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:04.970
Hey, is that?

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:11.350
Hello?

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:12.450
Yes.

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:16.590
They want us to turn ourselves in.

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:21.190
Aren't they late?

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:25.230
Hello?

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:27.200
What!?

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:28.690
But even now...

00:08:30.370 --> 00:08:31.670
But... wai-!

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:36.370
What's up, Shin?

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:39.410
Ito-san can't make his move right now.

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:40.280
What!?

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:43.420
Their higher-ups are putting a stop to this.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:00.200
Takuro, Kayano...

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:02.140
I...

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:03.190
Hey, Shin.

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:05.900
You're not going alone, are you?

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:10.100
You idiot. Geez.

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:14.680
That's no different from your brother.

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:19.120
My... dad, too.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:24.020
I know all of this is freaking
you out, but you know...

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:29.430
Before you try to take on things by
yourself and abandon your friends,

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:31.420
think about how those friends would feel.

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:33.330
Takuro...

00:09:47.180 --> 00:09:48.050
All right.

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:49.250
Kanzato-kun...

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:53.290
The reason why your parents
wrote picture books for children...

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:57.950
Maybe that was the only atonement
they could offer at the time.

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:16.640
Even if they knew they wouldn't be forgiven.

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:20.140
Maybe that was the only way.

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:27.120
You shouldn't feel responsible for this.

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:34.490
Maybe there's a greater purpose for
your Persona compared to ours, but...

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:40.430
Let's do something all of our Personas can do.

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:42.930
Jun-kun and Yuki-chan are doing the same, too.

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:44.430
Kayano...

00:10:57.490 --> 00:10:58.610
What can I?

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:01.150
What can my Persona do?

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:27.740
You went too far, Sanada-kun.

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:36.660
Your duty is to research the controversial issues
regarding development and control information.

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:39.160
In other words, protect confidentiality.

00:11:39.160 --> 00:11:41.060
No more, no less.

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:43.630
You mean concealment.

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:51.030
Looks like you've been very devoted, finding
any leaks regarding the Reverse cases.

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:55.510
You guys... already knew where they were.

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:58.370
That's actually another department.

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:02.840
If it were that simple, he wouldn't be so troubled.

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:05.420
A child was abducted.

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:09.490
I will participate in the interrogation, so please
hasten the placement of the special forces.

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:12.650
Didn't you encourage the abduction yourself?

00:12:13.760 --> 00:12:19.890
I didn't think you would go so far as to
gather latents to fight against them.

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:26.940
It's an unforgivable action not only as a
policeman, but as an adult with morals.

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:31.650
Things are already happening!
We have to head out now.

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:34.410
At least Kanzato Ryo was more understanding.

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:41.150
Well... I guess this "elite force"
was his idea to begin with.

00:12:43.890 --> 00:12:46.520
I won't let the manpower
you arranged go to waste.

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:48.720
We'll have them raid when it's time.

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:52.200
You intend to have them
leave with the research data!?

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:55.200
You are to remain here until further notice.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:57.470
Inui-kun.

00:12:57.640 --> 00:12:58.260
Yes, sir.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:02.270
Wha-? Hey!

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:08.710
My job is to do what the authorities desire.

00:13:13.220 --> 00:13:14.240
Hey, Counselor!

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:17.290
Ito-san, have you contacted Shin?

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:21.290
I told him to wait for our orders.

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:30.960
Go back to your friends.

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:33.400
What about you?

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:35.970
I...

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:38.740
I'm going back to my friends.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:44.380
Your memory is artificial.

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:49.980
Yamasaki Mayuri is just an artificial identity
created to help with your maintenance.

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:56.420
We stopped receiving the list of latents you
were gathering through Shadow Extraction.

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:00.670
That's why Yamasaki Mayuri appeared.

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:06.370
But when I think about it... To you, I was always...

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:29.030
Kanaru!

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:32.690
Megumi-san, why?

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:36.100
Oh, um, my Persona was...

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:38.530
Anyway, what are you doing here?

00:14:43.180 --> 00:14:43.730
Um...

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:46.280
I...

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:47.340
Morimoto!

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:55.220
Jun-kun is with the Marebito...
He should still be safe.

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:56.480
Shin.

00:14:57.590 --> 00:15:00.030
Kayano, stay here with Morimoto.

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:41.230
Ayane?

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:43.990
Is that... Yamasaki?

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:46.440
Yamasaki!

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:55.780
Stop!

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:05.690
Is that?

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:08.690
It was all me.

00:16:09.930 --> 00:16:15.460
I spread Shadow Extraction and
caused people to get attacked.

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:21.500
I'm the cause of Tasaka-senpai
and Okazaki-kun's cases.

00:16:22.780 --> 00:16:24.710
I don't remember, but...

00:16:25.110 --> 00:16:28.950
The killer at the karaoke shop...

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:30.540
was probably also...

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:35.980
I'm someone who belongs on the Marebito's side.

00:16:37.090 --> 00:16:38.020
No...

00:16:38.590 --> 00:16:39.960
I was just their puppet.

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:53.470
What did you do with Kanzato Jun's psyche?

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:58.740
The provision to get my Ayane back... Kanzato Shin.

00:16:58.910 --> 00:16:59.780
Kujo...

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:02.210
Komatsubara Keisuke.

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:12.160
You were a Marebito, too?

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.400
That flat-haired guy...

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:23.970
Takashi, and everyone else were...

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:29.140
Shin, go get Jun! I'll take care of her.

00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:41.580
Is it too tight?

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:10.850
Get Jun back.

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:13.520
And you, too, should dissolve.

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:16.180
Give me back Yuki!

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:22.630
Look out!

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:32.240
Morimoto!

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:41.380
Kanzato-kun, please help Kanaru!

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:55.460
Kanzato-kun!

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:13.070
Jun...

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:54.240
Shin-niichan.

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:57.710
Jun... Are you back?

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:03.520
Goodbye.

00:21:09.100 --> 00:21:09.860
Hey, Jun...

00:21:21.070 --> 00:21:21.840
Aniki...

00:21:52.940 --> 00:21:58.210
itsukara yume miru koto
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:21:58.210 --> 00:21:58.250
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:04.280
Wasureta huri wo shitetan darou
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:22:04.280 --> 00:22:10.520
Chiisana mado akeru yuuki mo naku
With no courage to open a small
window, I waited for a miracle

00:22:10.520 --> 00:22:10.560
With no courage to open a small
window, I waited for a miracle

00:22:10.560 --> 00:22:15.700
kiseki wo matteta
With no courage to open a small
window, I waited for a miracle

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:25.910
ushinau mono nado nakatta anohi no yona
I'm not as innocent as I used to be in
the days when I had nothing to lose

00:22:25.910 --> 00:22:25.940
I'm not as innocent as I used to be in
the days when I had nothing to lose

00:22:25.940 --> 00:22:31.280
mujakisa wa mou naikedo
I'm not as innocent as I used to be in
the days when I had nothing to lose

00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:37.480
namida wo nugutta ato niwa
After wiping away the tears

00:22:37.480 --> 00:22:43.390
atarashii jibun ni deaeru
I'll be able to meet a new self

00:22:43.390 --> 00:22:47.360
subete wo nakushitemo
mitsuke rareru monoga arukara
Even if I lose everything

00:22:47.360 --> 00:22:53.530
subete wo nakushitemo
mitsuke rareru monoga arukara
There are still some things to discover

00:22:53.530 --> 00:22:59.340
kesenai kizumo itsuka
Even the scars that remain

00:22:59.340 --> 00:23:06.710
watashi rashii hokori ni dekiru
will someday become my pride

00:23:11.390 --> 00:23:14.290
What have I accomplished?

00:23:14.290 --> 00:23:17.390
What am I to do now?

00:23:17.390 --> 00:23:20.950
Who am I? Where am I from?

00:23:21.430 --> 00:23:25.400
Even if I didn't exist, or I was nobody...

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:27.960
Even if nothing else remained...

00:23:28.270 --> 00:23:31.700
I was here with everyone.

00:23:32.740 --> 00:23:35.540
I loved you.

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:39.370
I lived.
